	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01gym0101_leader1a_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレは　ほのおタイプの
ポケモンで　あばれる　ポッド！▼
ずばり！　たのむから
オレの　パートナーに　なってくれよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-17T06:46:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:09:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレは　ほのおタイプの
ポケモンで　暴れる　ポッド！▼
ずばり！　頼むから
オレの　パートナーに　なってくれよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-17T06:46:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:09:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・初回
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→leader1a_02
　いいえ→leader1a_03
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER1C
ポッド（火）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:07:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T02:34:00" />
