	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01gym0101_leader1a_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ということで
ほのおタイプで　もやしまくる▽
オレ　ポッドの　つよさをみせるぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:16:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ということで
ほのおタイプで　燃やしまくる▽
オレ　ポッドの　強さをみせるぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:16:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・戦闘前メッセージ
　表示後、ダブルバトルへ
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER1C
ポッド（火）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:07:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
