		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01gym0101_leader1a_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポッド『オレも　つよかったけど
オマエも　なかなか　やるな！▼
どーだ！
デントに　コーン！▼
みつごで　いちばんの
ポケモントレーナーは　オレだろ！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-17T06:46:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:13:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポッド『オレも　強かったけど
オマエも　なかなか　やるな！▼
どーだ！
デントに　コーン！▼
三つ子で　一番の
ポケモントレーナーは　オレだろ！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-17T06:46:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:13:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・戦闘後
・再度、画面暗転、初期位置へ復帰
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER1C
ポッド（火）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:07:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T02:34:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01gym0101_leader1a_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うわーッ！　オマエ　すげえ！！▼
オマエと　くんでの　しょうぶ
あつく　もえあがったぜ！▽
よければ　また　きてくれよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:18:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:26:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うわーッ！　オマエ　すげえ！！▼
オマエと　組んでの　勝負
熱く　燃えあがったぜ！▽
よければ　また　来てくれよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:18:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:26:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・戦闘後+初期位置復帰後
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER1C
ポッド（火）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:07:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T02:34:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01gym0101_leader1a_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オマエと　くんだら　おもしろそうだな
よーし！　あした　オレと　くめ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:17:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オマエと　組んだら　おもしろそうだな
よーし！　明日　オレと　組め！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:26:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・組まずに戦闘後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T10:02:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER1C
ポッド（火）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T09:07:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
